UPDATE companies SET description='Industrial Metal Enterprises, LLC was founded in 1993 in Blackfoot, Idaho, operating as a limited liability company serving Eastern Idaho. The business began as a metal fabrication shop and has grown into a full-service contractor for industrial, commercial, and residential clients.

The company runs a machine shop equipped with a Haas TM-2P CNC mill (40" x 16" x 16" travel, 10,000 RPM spindle) and a water jet cutter, alongside CNC plasma cutting capacity. Its signature capability is a Super Tyro AST machine with Tru-Helix flight forming technology, described as the only such machine in the western United States, used to produce custom augers and sectional screw flights. The shop fabricates structural steel, stainless steel, carbon steel, aluminum, and specialty metals into conveyors, decks, platforms, handrails, stairs, sheet metal flashings, and ornamental pieces. Welding, pipe fitting, boiler and steam fitting, and mobile welding services round out the offering. In-house design produces 3D drawings for customer approval before fabrication.

Primary markets include food processing, where sanitary design conveyors and equipment are a focus, as well as broader industrial, commercial, and residential construction across Eastern Idaho. Customers range from food plants needing auger flights and sanitary conveyors to contractors requiring structural platforms, stairs, and custom metalwork.

The firm emphasizes on-time delivery and installation, competitive pricing, and the ability to take complicated, unique designs from concept through completion. Its Tru-Helix system reduces reliance on operator expertise for consistent screw flights, and the Haas TM-2P adds high-speed machining for precision parts.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "CNC milling (Haas TM-2P)", "Water jet cutting", "CNC plasma cutting", "Welding (multiple certifications)", "Pipe fitting and food process piping", "Boiler, hot water heating, and steam fitting", "Mobile welding", "Custom auger and sectional screw flight forming (Tru-Helix)", "Custom conveyor fabrication (sanitary design)", "Deck, platform, handrail, and stair fabrication", "Sheet metal flashing and roof specialties", "Specialty and ornamental metalwork", "Project planning and design", "3D CAD modeling and drawing approval", "On-site repairs", "Erection and installation"], "industries": ["Food processing", "Industrial", "Commercial", "Residential"], "materials": ["Stainless steel", "Carbon steel", "Aluminum", "Specialty metals", "Slipnot", "All-Grip", "Perforated metal", "Grating"], "equipment": ["Super Tyro AST machine (Tru-Helix flight forming)", "Haas TM-2P CNC mill", "Water jet cutter", "CNC plasma cutter"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Super Tyro AST machine with Tru-Helix flight forming technology (only machine in the West)", "Haas TM-2P CNC mill with 10,000 RPM spindle and 20-tool changer", "3D drawings provided for approval before fabrication", "Sanitary design expertise for food processing equipment", "On-time delivery and installation with mobile welding service"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1993 in Blackfoot, Idaho -> db", "Super Tyro AST machine with Tru-Helix flight forming technology -> /", "Haas TM-2P CNC mill specifications (40\" x 16\" x 16\" travel, 10,000 RPM) -> /", "Water jet and CNC plasma cutting capabilities -> /s