UPDATE companies SET description='Inter-Coastal Electronics (ICE) operates from Mesa, Arizona, and serves as the current Tactical Engagement Simulation System (TESS) Program of Record holder for U.S. Army aviation.

ICE designs, develops, manufactures, tests, delivers, and supports live training systems that increase warfighter effectiveness and survivability. Its product portfolio includes TESS production kits with ground support equipment, the TOW-ITAS Laser Integrated Field Training System (LIFTS), the Training ASE Stimulation Suite (TASS), and the Army TADSS Maintenance Program (ATMP). The company handles engineering, production planning, depot repair, supply chain management, and systems integration for ruggedized electronics and embedded systems.

ICE supports U.S. Army aviation platforms at Combat Training Centers including the National Training Center (NTC), Joint Readiness Training Center (JRTC), and Joint Multinational Readiness Center (JMRC). International customers include the Netherlands, United Kingdom, United Arab Emirates, Taiwan, Qatar, and Morocco, with programs covering AH-64E Apache, UH-60M Black Hawk, CH-47F Chinook, and TOW missile systems.

The company emphasizes a low-risk, cost-effective approach that provides immediate interoperability with existing Army ranges and a Modular Open Systems Architecture (MOSA) to reduce lifecycle costs. Leadership includes veterans with extensive Army aviation and acquisition experience, guiding a strategy focused on readiness, proficiency, and affordability.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Live training system design and development", "Embedded training electronics manufacturing", "TESS (Tactical Engagement Simulation System) production", "TOW-ITAS LIFTS (Laser Integrated Field Training System) production and support", "TASS (Training ASE Stimulation Suite) development", "Army TADSS Maintenance Program (ATMP) execution", "Systems integration and ruggedized product development", "Environmental and electromagnetic qualification testing", "Depot repair and maintenance services", "Production planning and supply chain management", "Program management and earned value management (EVMS)", "Engineering services for avionics and weapons processors"], "industries": ["U.S. Army aviation", "International military forces", "Combat training centers (NTC, JRTC, JMRC)", "Defense training simulation", "Aerospace and defense"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Current TESS Program of Record holder for U.S. Army aviation", "Low-risk, cost-effective embedded training solutions with immediate range interoperability", "Modular Open Systems Architecture (MOSA) approach for reduced lifecycle costs", "30 years of embedded training experience across Army aviation platforms", "Veteran-led leadership with direct Army acquisition and operational background"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Mesa, Arizona -> db", "Current TESS Program of Record holder for US Army aviation -> /", "Provides embedded training solutions with 30 years experience -> /", "Designs, develops, manufactures, tests, delivers, and supports live training solutions -> /about", "Produces TESS kits, LIFTS, TASS, ATMP -> /", "Supports US Army at NTC, JRTC, JMRC and international customers (Netherlands, UK, UAE, Taiwan, Qatar, Morocco) -> /", "Leadership team includes David Weston (President), Kyle Preston (CFO), Ben Covington (VP Programs), Jim Barker (VP Business Development), George Ferido (Strategy Director), Ryan Kirkpatrick (Director of Engineering), Matt Hitchon (Principal Engineer) -> /about", "Emphasizes MOSA approach, low-risk, cost-effective, immediate interoperability -> /", "FAAC''s Vehicle and Air Warfare Simulation Divisions appraised at CMMI maturity level 3 -> /quality"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "ICE is a forward-thinking innovator and global market leader that designs, develops, manufactures, tests, delivers, and supports live training solutions", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='inter-coastal-electronics-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
